        "title": "Welcome to alpha - Acroxa CMS Alpha",
        "slug": "welcome-to-acroxa-cms-alpha",
        "content": "<h1>🎉 Welcome to Acroxa CMS Alpha!</h1>\n        <p>Congratulations on setting up your new Acroxa CMS installation!</p>\n        <p>This is your first post. You can edit or delete it from the admin dashboard.</p>",
